      <title>Test-Cache地址映射</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/05/Test-Cache%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/05/Test-Cache%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%98%A0%E5%B0%84/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="基本概念">基本概念</h2><p>Cache利用程序访问的时间局部性和空间局部性。</p><p>主存地址通常被划分为：</p><p><spanclass="math display">主存地址 = 标记位 + 组号 + 块内地址</span></p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="直接映射">直接映射</h2><p>直接映射满足：</p><p><spanclass="math display">Cache行号 = 主存块号 mod  Cache行数</span></p><h2 id="易错点">易错点</h2><ol type="1"><li>块内地址位数由块大小决定。</li><li>标记位不包含有效位和脏位。</li><li>注意区分主存块号与Cache行号。</li></ol><h2 id="例题">例题</h2><p>假设主存地址为32位，Cache数据区容量为32 KB，块大小为64 B。</p><p>块内地址位数为：</p><p><span class="math display">log<sub>2</sub>64 = 6</span></p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>&#123;<br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, Hexo!&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/img/postBanner.jpg" alt="Test1" /> <imgsrc="/img/post/test.png" alt="Test2" /></p>]]></content>
      
      
